 de Fecha')\n","plt.ylabel('Retornos Diarios')\n","plt.xticks(rotation=45, ha='right') # Rotar etiquetas para mayor legibilidad\n","plt.grid(axis='y', linestyle='--')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"id":"uuNhD-_XxMrr"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["¿Cómo ha evolucionado el rendimiento de Apple a lo largo del tiempo?"],"metadata":{"id":"qZT0WRvkoAkM"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["plt.figure(figsize=(14, 6))\n","plt.plot(df_retornos['Date'], df_retornos['Apple_Retornos'], label='Apple', color='red')\n","\n","# Formato de fechas cada 5 años\n","locator = mdates.YearLocator(5)\n","formatter = mdates.DateFormatter('%Y')\n","ax = plt.gca()\n","ax.xaxis.set_major_locator(locator)\n","ax.xaxis.set_major_formatter(formatter)\n","\n","# Forzar el límite hasta 2025\n","ax.set_xlim([pd.Timestamp('1985-01-01'), pd.Timestamp('2025-12-31')])\n","\n","plt.title('Volarilidad de Apple')\n","plt.xlabel('Fecha')\n","plt.ylabel('Retorno diario')\n","plt.grid(True)\n","plt.legend()\n","plt.xticks(rotation=45)\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"id":"bzA-oy0loRcz"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["¿Cuál es la relación entre los movimientos de Apple?\n"],"metadata":{"id":"4GYoNJgwqTsw"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["correlation_matrix = df_retornos[['Apple_Retornos', 'Microsoft_Retornos', 'UNH_Retornos']].corr()\n","sns.heatmap(correlation_matrix, annot=True, cmap='coolwarm')\n","plt.title('Matriz de correlación de volatilidad')\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"id":"LRuur0Dnqcc6"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["3. Volatilidad mensual"],"metadata":{"id":"hH_SDS7eqnFo"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["df_retornos['Date'] = pd.to_datetime(df_retornos['Date'], dayfirst=True)"],"metadata":{"id":"SRjmEsH0u3XI"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["df_retornos['Month'] = df_retornos